#: ../../source/reference/computebuffer.rst:13
msgid ""
"The ComputeBuffer class provides functionality to manage and manipulate "
"data buffers used in compute shaders. The count method retrieves the "
"number of elements, stride gets and sets the stride of the buffer, and "
"data gets the current data stored in the buffer. The setData method "
"allows updating the buffer data and marks the buffer as dirty."
msgstr ""

